1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
削面的刀，不是菜刀
This blade's no kitchen knife

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
是一片弯弯的铁
Just a curved sheet of iron

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
面团顶在手掌上
A dough lump on the palm

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
刀贴着面飞过去
The blade skims right across

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
柳叶片，中厚边薄
Willow leaves, thick core thin rim

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
一分钟，两百多根
Over two hundred a minute

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
相传起于元代
Said to start in the Yuan

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
铁器被收，才有削面
Knives seized, so dough got shaved

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
八百年，削成绝活
Eight hundred years, now a craft

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
直直落进滚水
Straight down into boiling water

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
你敢挑战刀削面吗？
Could you shave noodles like this?

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,500
下集：一勺滚油，泼出满碗香
Next: one ladle of sizzling oil
